#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:4
msgid "Cloud Deployment"
msgstr "云部署"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:6
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab can be run in various cloud infrastructures with the use of `Isaac"
" Automator <https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacAutomator>`__ (v4)."
msgstr ""
"通过 `Isaac Automator <https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacAutomator>`__ "
"（v4），可以在多种云基础设施上运行 Isaac Lab。"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:9
msgid ""
"Isaac Automator allows quick deployment of Isaac Sim, Isaac Lab, and Isaac "
"Lab Arena onto public clouds (AWS, GCP, Azure, and Alibaba Cloud are "
"currently supported). The result is a fully configured remote desktop cloud "
"workstation (Isaac Workstation), which can be used for development and "
"testing of Isaac Lab within minutes and on a budget. Isaac Automator "
"supports a variety of GPU instances and stop/start functionality to save on "
"cloud costs, and provides tools to aid the workflow (uploading and "
"downloading data, autorun scripts, deployment management, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Automator 可将 Isaac Sim、Isaac Lab 和 Isaac Lab Arena 快速部署到公有云，目前支持 "
"AWS、GCP、Azure 和阿里云。部署结果是配置完整的远程桌面云工作站（Isaac Workstation），可在几分钟内以较低成本用于 Isaac"
" Lab 开发和测试。Isaac Automator 支持多种 GPU "
"实例，以及用于节省云费用的停止、启动功能，还提供数据上传下载、自动运行脚本和部署管理等辅助工具。"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:19
msgid "System Requirements"
msgstr "系统要求"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:21
msgid ""
"Isaac Automator requires having ``docker`` pre-installed on the system."
msgstr "Isaac Automator 需要预先在系统上安装 ``docker`` 。"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:23
msgid ""
"To install Docker, please follow the instructions for your operating system "
"on the `Docker Engine website`_."
msgstr ""
"安装 Docker 时，按照 `Docker Engine 网站 <Docker Engine website_>`_ 上对应操作系统的说明操作。"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:25
msgid ""
"Follow the post-installation steps for Docker on the `Docker post-"
"installation steps`_ page. These steps allow you to run Docker without using"
" ``sudo``."
msgstr ""
"完成 `Docker 安装后步骤 <Docker post-installation steps_>`_ ，以便无需 ``sudo`` 即可运行 "
"Docker。"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:30
msgid "Installing Isaac Automator"
msgstr "安装 Isaac Automator"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:32
msgid ""
"For the most up-to-date and complete installation instructions, please refer"
" to the `Isaac Automator README <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacAutomator?tab=readme-ov-file#installation>`__."
msgstr ""
"最新、完整的安装说明见 `Isaac Automator README <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacAutomator?tab=readme-ov-file#installation>`__ 。"

