#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:80
msgid "Deploying an Isaac Workstation"
msgstr "部署 Isaac Workstation"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:88
msgid "Enter the Automator container and run the deployment command:"
msgstr "进入 Automator 容器，运行部署命令："

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:96
msgid "Alternatively, run it in one step:"
msgstr "也可以一步运行："

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:111
msgid ""
"Replace ``deploy-aws`` with ``deploy-gcp``, ``deploy-azure``, or ``deploy-"
"alicloud`` for other cloud providers."
msgstr ""
"使用其他云服务时，将 ``deploy-aws`` 替换为 ``deploy-gcp`` 、 ``deploy-azure`` 或 ``deploy-"
"alicloud`` 。"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:116
msgid ""
"The ``--isaaclab`` and ``--isaacsim`` flags accept any valid Git reference "
"to specify the version to deploy. Use ``--isaaclab no`` or ``--isaacsim no``"
" to skip installation of the respective component."
msgstr ""
"``--isaaclab`` 和 ``--isaacsim`` 接受任意有效 Git 引用，用来指定部署版本。 ``--isaaclab no`` 或 "
"``--isaacsim no`` 可跳过相应组件的安装。"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:124
msgid ""
"On the first run (or when credentials expire), you will be prompted to enter"
" your cloud credentials. Credentials are stored in ``state/`` and persist "
"across container restarts. Run ``./deploy-<cloud> --help`` to see all "
"available options."
msgstr ""
"首次运行或凭据过期时，会提示输入云凭据。凭据存放在 ``state/`` 中，容器重启后仍保留。运行 ``./deploy-<cloud> "
"--help`` 查看全部选项。"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:129
msgid "Key deployment options:"
msgstr "主要部署选项："

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:131
msgid "``--instance-type`` -- Cloud VM instance type."
msgstr "``--instance-type`` ：云虚拟机实例类型。"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:132
msgid ""
"``--isaacsim`` / ``--isaaclab`` / ``--isaaclab-arena`` -- Git ref for the "
"version to install, or ``no`` to skip."
msgstr ""
"``--isaacsim`` / ``--isaaclab`` / ``--isaaclab-arena`` ：要安装版本的 Git 引用； "
"``no`` 表示跳过。"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:134
msgid ""
"``--existing`` -- What to do if a deployment already exists: ``ask`` "
"(default), ``repair``, ``modify``, ``replace``, or ``run_ansible``."
msgstr ""
"``--existing`` ：部署已存在时的处理方式，可选 ``ask`` （默认）、 ``repair`` 、 ``modify`` 、 "
"``replace`` 或 ``run_ansible`` 。"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:136
msgid ""
"``--from-image`` -- Deploy from a pre-built VM image for faster provisioning"
" (AWS, Azure, or GCP)."
msgstr "``--from-image``：从预构建的虚拟机镜像部署，加快环境配置，支持 AWS、Azure 或 GCP。"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:140
msgid "Connecting to the Isaac Workstation"
msgstr "连接 Isaac Workstation"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:142
msgid "Deployed Isaac Workstations can be accessed via:"
msgstr "部署后的 Isaac Workstation 可通过以下方式访问："

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:144
msgid "**SSH**: ``./ssh <deployment-name>``"
msgstr "**SSH** ： ``./ssh <deployment-name>``"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:145
msgid "**noVNC** (browser-based): ``./novnc <deployment-name>``"
msgstr "**noVNC** （浏览器）： ``./novnc <deployment-name>``"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:146
msgid "**NoMachine** (remote desktop client)"
msgstr "**NoMachine** （远程桌面客户端）"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:148
msgid ""
"Connection instructions are displayed at the end of the deployment command "
"output and saved in ``state/<deployment-name>/info.txt``."
msgstr "连接说明显示在部署命令输出末尾，并保存在 ``state/<deployment-name>/info.txt`` 。"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:153
msgid "Running Isaac Lab on the Cloud"
msgstr "在云中运行 Isaac Lab"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:155
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab is installed from source on the deployed workstation at "
"``~/IsaacLab``. To run Isaac Lab commands, open a terminal on the "
"workstation:"
msgstr "部署的工作站在 ``~/IsaacLab`` 中从源码安装 Isaac Lab。运行 Isaac Lab 命令时，在工作站打开终端："

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:165
msgid "Pausing and Resuming"
msgstr "暂停与恢复"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:167
msgid "You can stop and restart instances to save on cloud costs:"
msgstr "停止和重新启动实例，可以节省云费用："

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:175
msgid ""
"Use ``./start <deployment-name> --quick`` to skip full Ansible provisioning "
"and only run the autorun script."
msgstr "使用 ``./start <deployment-name> --quick`` ，可跳过完整 Ansible 配置，只运行自动启动脚本。"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:180
msgid "Uploading and Downloading Data"
msgstr "上传与下载数据"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:192
msgid "Destroying a Deployment"
msgstr "销毁部署"

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:194
msgid "To save costs, destroy deployments when no longer needed:"
msgstr "不再需要时，销毁部署以节省费用："

#: source/workflows/docker/cloud.rst:203
msgid ""
"Deployment metadata is stored in the ``state/`` directory. Do not delete "
"this directory, as it is required for managing deployments."
msgstr "部署元数据位于 ``state/`` 目录。管理部署需要该目录，不要删除。"
